%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: AFU_Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 16bec568f3680914b892c4018b766c2f, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 47017676951552
    m_Localized: Hello young fellow! You look like you're lost? How about some help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314257315909632
    m_Localized: Since you're new around here let me give you a few tips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47031874670592
    m_Localized: All my flo-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47051256549376
    m_Localized: ANYWAYYY *Didn't ask your whole life story here*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47061553565696
    m_Localized: I have an old nest around here if you want it? It's a fixer-upper
      but still....good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314243671838720
    m_Localized: Check the nest! Maybe I left a few laying around?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53441740066816
    m_Localized: Alright
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53560052994048
    m_Localized: 'GREAT! It''s over near the picnic tables! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314207697293312
    m_Localized: Back in my day we would sleep on spikes and be HAPPY. *SCOFF* Okay
      maybe you could spruce it up with a few sticks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53686830026752
    m_Localized: Are pigeon nest supposed to look that....bad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858535531433984
    m_Localized: AHHHHHHH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858615307096064
    m_Localized: Oh-- It's you! You have to stop scaring the feathers off me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858656721653760
    m_Localized: Almost ruined my hiding spot as well!! Those humans over there knocked
      the plumage off me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858676174835712
    m_Localized: Did you know that legend says we once helped humans? Carried mail
      thousands of kilometers for them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858715718733824
    m_Localized: We were heroes! Sky messengers! Tiny feathery delivery legends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858725592125440
    m_Localized: Sounds crazy, I know. Now they mostly just chase and yell at us.
      Soo SCARY! Humans are unpredictable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858767568719872
    m_Localized: "They tend to throw things, kick, or chase you if they spot you.
      So when you wanna be invisible\u2026 you gotta sneak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858778331303936
    m_Localized: Hold down LEFT CTRL OR LEFT BUMPER and move slowly. Stay behind
      stuff. Boxes. Benches. Fences. Decorative shrubbery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858793414021120
    m_Localized: "To sprint hold down the LEFT SHIFT OR L3.  It will take you out
      of the stealth mode so be speedy!! If you see something you want\u2026 snatch
      it up with F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858805535559680
    m_Localized: Feeling confident?  I need some help. I dropped this sweet KEYCHAIN
      inside the THEATRE! And its crowded with people!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858816449138688
    m_Localized: If you can grab it, I'll let you keep it! Maybe you'll find some
      use for it later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858827740205056
    m_Localized: "Try to sneak past the humans. If they see you\u2026 you better
      move those little feet!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858854894129152
    m_Localized: Oh. That's okay. That's fine. I'll just go... and get it myself.
      That's good. I like to practice. Practice is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858866810146816
    m_Localized: Just kidding. This one is all you. GO!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858879363698688
    m_Localized: "YOU DID IT!!! You\u2019re the bravest bird I know. Which is not
      a high bar but still!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858898321952768
    m_Localized: "OMG! HI!! You\u2019re here!! Okay don\u2019t freak out but I found
      the BEST stuff!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858909378138112
    m_Localized: "It was in a garbage can!! Which means it\u2019s premium."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858920618872832
    m_Localized: "Okay so like \u2014 see shiny? Or crunchy? Or vaguely food-shaped?
      Just run over and eat! If you can't EAT it, try to GRAB it by HOLDING F or
      X BUTTON"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858930215440384
    m_Localized: If you're already full you can find it in your wingventory!  Press
      I OR UP DIRECTION PAD to check out what you got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858930601316352
    m_Localized: " Now here\u2019s the BEST part. Use LEFT CLICK OR RIGHT TRIGGER
      to poop on those pesky humans! And RIGHT CLICK OR LEFT TRIGGER to aim so you
      waste less!\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858949450518528
    m_Localized: "When your poop meter gets low \u2014 You gotta eat. Garbage snacks
      fill it back up. Nature is BEAUTIFUL."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858957461639168
    m_Localized: "Garbage cans are like mystery boxes! Use E OR X BUTTON to interact!
      You never know what you\u2019ll get!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858965699252224
    m_Localized: "Maybe fries. Maybe bread. Maybe something that builds character.
      If it wiggles, maybe don\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858974268215296
    m_Localized: 'Hey there kid! You ready to learn some sick moves?

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858985622196224
    m_Localized: "Relax your feathers. The sky\u2019s chill. It only looks big. Okay
      yeah it\u2019s massive. But you\u2019ll be fine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858996628049920
    m_Localized: "You know the basics but you want more! Flying fast is easy. Flying
      cool? That\u2019s skill."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859006878928896
    m_Localized: Need to dive down quickly? Use Q. Maybe a softer approach? Hover
      with G or just glide on down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859020745297920
    m_Localized: Now let's see you put it all together. Look for race posters like
      the one on this sign and test your wings! Show me what you got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288797528936448
    m_Localized: Try using that manhole for a boost so you have a better chance of
      getting to the top of that building. It's a great place to hide from angry
      humans!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288790117601280
    m_Localized: Now I say this because I care.... But you look.... weak. You'll
      get stronger but we all need some help sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288765664808960
    m_Localized: Everybody knows us for pooping everywhere. But you need to fill
      up your tank first! There's bound to be some food around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288803342241792
    m_Localized: How did you get up here so fast?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288808417349632
    m_Localized: Fast...? You took so long I almost left!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288815488946176
    m_Localized: You know where to find food.You know how to stay safe. I've saved
      the best for last!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288820656328704
    m_Localized: See those humans down there? You know what to do! Make me proud!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288830890430464
    m_Localized: I've taught you everything I know already. Time to go find some
      other birds to bother!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288840398917632
    m_Localized: HEY!! HEY COO!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288848867217408
    m_Localized: Do I know you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288856677011456
    m_Localized: Nope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288863077519360
    m_Localized: BUT has anybody told you that you look JUST like someone I know?
      Suspiciously identical *SQUINTS*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288910452183040
    m_Localized: You NEED to meet them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288919834841088
    m_Localized: That's...not helpful. Who is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288926696722432
    m_Localized: Since you're going anyways, can you bring them this bread I owe?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288933424386048
    m_Localized: Can't you do it yourself? I didn't agree to this?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288944136638464
    m_Localized: ... I get by with a little help from my friends?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288956249788416
    m_Localized: 'Of course you do.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288964126691328
    m_Localized: "You look\u2026 familiar? Odd.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288973677121536
    m_Localized: 'Wingo told me to bring this to you? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288987216334848
    m_Localized: Ah the bread he owes. What a WILD night. Thank Wingo for me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22288994841579520
    m_Localized: "Oh I'm not going back there. I've never met them in my life\u2026
      and they kind of scare me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289000399032320
    m_Localized: There are lots of us around! Us pigeons have strong genes *winks*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289005453168640
    m_Localized: "You'll find someone to talk to\u2026I met a bird around here not
      long ago! Spoke with a strange accent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289010423418880
    m_Localized: 'Oh! Take these for your trouble. It''s the least I can do.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289023526424576
    m_Localized: 'I SAY, My good fellow!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289031155863552
    m_Localized: 'You look young and sprightly, tough enough to scare a CAT or two!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289039905181696
    m_Localized: Mind helping an old chap like myself with a dilemma?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289049338171392
    m_Localized: Uhhh. I'm a bit busy-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289058607583232
    m_Localized: EXCELLENT my dear bird! Thank you so much!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289068019601408
    m_Localized: "A pack of mongrels have taken a liking to my favorite alleyway.
      They have the finest selection here you see\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289074185228288
    m_Localized: Not too moldy... but just enough to add some flavor! No other will
      do!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289080057253888
    m_Localized: Anywho, those brutes have kept me out long enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289092292038656
    m_Localized: Give them a good wallop of POOP! THAT oughta teach them a lesson!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289097505558528
    m_Localized: Oh, I think a young bird got stuck in there too. You look quite
      like her! Yes! Yes Indeed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289102974930944
    m_Localized: ..but more importantly - PLEASE HELP ME GET MY SNACKS BACK!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289110713421824
    m_Localized: Tally Ho dear friend! - Yes. Off you go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289118481272832
    m_Localized: You found me!! I was SOO scared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289125649338368
    m_Localized: I was hoping Arnesto would.. come but I'm soo glad to see you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289134994247680
    m_Localized: "Thanks\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289144532094976
    m_Localized: Do you know that bird over there? He ran away when the cats came
      yelling " EAT HER! EAT HER!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289154355154944
    m_Localized: Pish posh - Now off you go! Out of my alleyway!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289159644172288
    m_Localized: 'Don''t worry, I''m gone... '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289164488593408
    m_Localized: I'm going to go rest my wings after such an awful day!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289168934555648
    m_Localized: Oh! Before I go, I met the strangest old Crow. He has a shop around
      here somewhere! Maybe he'll have something you can trade those trinkets for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289174479425536
    m_Localized: He usually hangs out in alleyways but be careful for these pesky
      cats. You don't want to spend the night in a dumpster like me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289185615302656
    m_Localized: I hear you are looking for trinkets?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289193580285952
    m_Localized: "Shop is closed. Come back later\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289225020788736
    m_Localized: "........ I can see the \u2026 Ok I see what's happening. What do
      you need?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289232805416960
    m_Localized: 'A fair trade, is it not? Trinkets for treasures? A deed for a deed. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289259170811904
    m_Localized: This stall has become my prison. I seek a ROSE for my true love.
      Only they can make me feel FREE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289271736946688
    m_Localized: You know you can just leave right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289281174130688
    m_Localized: A traveller of the sky, burdened with purpose. Tell me, do winds
      whisper secrets to thee as they do to me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289290674229248
    m_Localized: I get it. Very poetic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289306096685056
    m_Localized: Bring me the rose and you may trade with me. Until then, we're closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289311423451136
    m_Localized: "Crow finds wares\u2026 if you have trinkets.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22289316238512128
    m_Localized: Who...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
